{%- doc -%}
  PDP product pill.

  Uses the same expression the product card already uses, at
  snippets/product-card.liquid:231 -

    product.metafields.custom.pile_type.value | default: product.type

  so the PDP pill and the card pill can never disagree: one source of truth,
  the existing Pile type metaobject with the product type as the fallback. No
  new field, no new logic, nothing hardcoded.

  Renders nothing when neither value is set, so a product without a pile type
  or a type shows no empty pill.

  Usage - a "Liquid" block at the top of the product information column:

    {% render 'pdp-product-pill' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign product_tag = product.metafields.custom.pile_type.value | default: product.type
-%}

{%- if product_tag != blank -%}
  <div class="pdp-pills">
    <span class="pdp-pill">{{ product_tag }}</span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
